  "name": "Her Art Here – New York/New Jersey",
  "kind": "special",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "drawnOn": "B752",
  "description": "Fuselage: White, artwork on the sides; white underside. Forward, from the nose to the wing: a field of teal and royal-blue brush shapes from the crown to below the windows, a teal patch on the nose, a purple barn-like building with a white house just behind the cockpit, and a navy tree-lined shore under the windows. Aft, from the wing to the tail cone: the New York skyline in navy, blue and purple from below the windows (taller towers to the crown), the Brooklyn Bridge by the wing and the Statue of Liberty's head in faceted teal and navy ahead of the fin; white above the skyline. Tail: Standard United blue fin with the light-blue globe. Engines: Royal-blue cowlings, polished lips. Winglets: Blue. Titles: Large, widely spaced 'UNITED' in navy with a thin white outline over the forward windows. Artwork: Corinne Antonelli's New York/New Jersey design.",
